      "body": "## Finding description and impact\n- `Distributor._distributeAssets` sends realized rewards to `msg.sender`. In stake/unstake flows, `msg.sender` is `Launchpad`, not the user.\n- `Launchpad` has no ERC20 forwarding or rescue; rewards accumulate on `Launchpad` and users don’t receive them. Accounting reduces `totalPendingRewards`, so value is effectively locked.\n- Users can trigger this by causing any update (stake/unstake vis buy/sell) to realize pending; the PoC confirms both paths.\n\n- Setup (stake exists)\nDuring buy, \n  - `LaunchToken.transfer(userA, S)` → `LaunchToken._increaseFeeShares` → `Launchpad.increaseStake(userA, S)` → `Distributor.increaseStake(baseToken, userA, S)`\n  - State: `totalShares = S`, `userA.shares = S`\n\n- Add rewards\n  - `Distributor.addRewards(baseToken, quoteToken, 0, R)`\n  - State: `pendingQuoteRewards += R`, `totalPendingRewards[quoteToken] += R`\n\n- Trigger via stake (pays Launchpad)\n  - `LaunchToken.transfer(userA, δ)` → `Launchpad.increaseStake(userA, δ)` → `Distributor.increaseStake(baseToken, userA, δ)`\n  - Payout: `Distributor._distributeAssets` → `quoteToken.safeTransfer(msg.sender, R)` where `msg.sender == Launchpad`\n  - Accounting: `totalPendingRewards[quoteToken] -= R`\n\n- Trigger via unstake (also pays Launchpad)\n  - `LaunchToken.transfer(launchpad, δ)` → `Launchpad.decreaseStake(userA, δ)` → `Distributor.decreaseStake(baseToken, userA, δ)`\n  - payout again to `Launchpad` via `safeTransfer(msg.sender, R)`\n\n- Result\n  - User gets 0; `Launchpad` balance of `quoteToken` increases by `R`\n  - No ERC20 forward/rescue on `Launchpad` → rewards stuck on `Launchpad`\n\n\n\n### Affected code (root cause)\n\nhttps://github.com/code-423n4/2025-08-gte-perps/blob/f43e1eedb65e7e0327cfaf4d7608a37d85d2fae7/contracts/launchpad/Distributor.sol#L170-L175\n\n```195:205:contracts/launchpad/Distributor.sol\nfunction _distributeAssets(address base, uint256 baseAmount, address quote, uint256 quoteAmount) internal {\n    if (baseAmount > 0) {\n        _decreaseTotalPending(base, baseAmount);\n        base.safeTransfer(msg.sender, baseAmount);\n    }\n\n    if (quoteAmount > 0) {\n        _decreaseTotalPending(quote, quoteAmount);\n        quote.safeTransfer(msg.sender, quoteAmount);\n    }\n}\n```\n\nhttps://github.com/code-423n4/2025-08-gte-perps/blob/f43e1eedb65e7e0327cfaf4d7608a37d85d2fae7/contracts/launchpad/Launchpad.sol#L423\n\n```441:447:contracts/launchpad/Launchpad.sol\nfunction increaseStake(address account, uint96 shares) external onlyLaunchAsset {\n    distributor.increaseStake(msg.sender, account, shares);\n}\n\nfunction decreaseStake(address account, uint96 shares) external onlyLaunchAsset {\n    distributor.decreaseStake(msg.sender, account, shares);\n}\n```\n\nhttps://github.com/code-423n4/2025-08-gte-perps/blob/f43e1eedb65e7e0327cfaf4d7608a37d85d2fae7/contracts/launchpad/LaunchToken.sol#L131\n\n```122:134:contracts/launchpad/LaunchToken.sol\nfunction _increaseFeeShares(address account, uint256 amount) internal {\n    if (amount == 0 || account == address(0)) return;\n    emit FeeShareIncreased(account, amount, _incEventNonce());\n    unchecked { totalFeeShare += amount; bondingShare[account] += amount; }\n    ILaunchpad(launchpad).increaseStake(account, uint96(amount));\n}\n```\n\n```138:158:contracts/launchpad/LaunchToken.sol\nfunction _decreaseFeeShares(address account, uint256 amount) internal {\n    uint256 share = bondingShare[account];\n    if (share == 0 || account == address(0)) return;\n    amount = amount > share ? share : amount;\n    emit FeeShareDecreased(account, amount, _incEventNonce());\n    unchecked { totalFeeShare -= amount; bondingShare[account] -= amount; }\n    if (totalFeeShare == 0 && !unlocked) _endRewards();\n    ILaunchpad(launchpad).decreaseStake(account, uint96(amount));\n}\n```\n\n```419:425:contracts/launchpad/Launchpad.sol\nfunction pullFees() external onlyOwner {\n    (bool success,) = payable(msg.sender).call{value: address(this).balance}(\"\");\n    if (!success) revert ETHTransferFailed();\n}\n```\n\n## Recommended mitigation steps\n\n- In `Distributor`, change distribution recipient to the actual `account` on stake/unstake:\n  - Pass `account` to `increaseStake`/`decreaseStake` internals and use it in `_distributeAssets` instead of `msg.sender`.\n- Or, have `Launchpad` capture returned amounts and immediately forward ERC20s to `account`",
      "proofOfConcept": "<details>\n\n<summary> \nAttached POC (click to drop down)\n</summary>\n\n1. Replace `test/c4-poc/PoCLaunchpad.t.sol` completely as shown below\n2. then run  `forge t --mc PoCLaunchpad  -vvv`\n\n```solidity\n\n// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\npragma solidity ^0.8.0;\n\nimport {LaunchpadTestBase} from \"./LaunchpadTestBase.sol\";\nimport {Distributor} from \"contracts/launchpad/Distributor.sol\";\nimport \"contracts/launchpad/libraries/RewardsTracker.sol\";\nimport {MockERC20} from \"forge-std/mocks/MockERC20.sol\";\nimport {SafeTransferLib} from \"solady/utils/SafeTransferLib.sol\";\nimport {LaunchToken} from \"contracts/launchpad/LaunchToken.sol\";\n\ncontract PoCLaunchpad is LaunchpadTestBase {\n    using SafeTransferLib for address;\n\n    /**\n     * PoC can utilize the following variables to access the relevant contracts:\n     * - factory: ERC1967Factory.sol \n     * - launchpad: Launchpad.sol\n     * - distributor: Distributor.sol (via address(distributor))\n     * - curve: SimpleBondingCurve.sol\n     * - launchpadLPVault: LaunchpadLPVault.sol\n     * - quoteToken: Quote token used in Launchpad system\n     * - uniV2Router: Uniswap V2 Router used in Launchpad system\n     */\n\n    function test_submissionValidity() external {\n    }\n\n    function test_RewardsPaidToLaunchpad_OnStake() public {\n        Distributor d = Distributor(distributor);\n\n        address baseToken = token;\n        address qToken = address(quoteToken);\n        address lp = address(launchpad);\n        address userA = makeAddr(\"userA\");\n\n        // 1) Seed shares for userA by transferring from Launchpad (allowed during bonding)\n        vm.prank(lp);\n        LaunchToken(baseToken).transfer(userA, 1 ether);\n\n        // 2) Donate quote rewards\n        uint256 reward = 100 ether;\n        deal(qToken, address(this), reward);\n        quoteToken.approve(address(d), type(uint256).max);\n        d.addRewards(baseToken, qToken, 0, uint128(reward));\n        assertEq(d.totalPendingRewards(qToken), reward);\n\n        // 3) Trigger stake update to realize pending rewards\n        uint256 beforeLpQuote = quoteToken.balanceOf(lp);\n        uint256 beforeUserQuote = quoteToken.balanceOf(userA);\n\n        vm.prank(lp);\n        LaunchToken(baseToken).transfer(userA, 1); // small additional stake\n\n        // 4) Rewards were paid to Launchpad, not user; pending cleared\n        assertEq(d.totalPendingRewards(qToken), 0);\n        assertEq(quoteToken.balanceOf(lp) - beforeLpQuote, reward);\n        assertEq(quoteToken.balanceOf(userA) - beforeUserQuote, 0);\n    }\n\n    function test_RewardsPaidToLaunchpad_OnUnstake() public {\n        Distributor d = Distributor(distributor);\n\n        address baseToken = token;\n        address qToken = address(quoteToken);\n        address lp = address(launchpad);\n        address userA = makeAddr(\"userA\");\n\n        // 1) Seed shares\n        vm.prank(lp);\n        LaunchToken(baseToken).transfer(userA, 1 ether);\n\n        // 2) Donate quote rewards\n        uint256 reward = 55 ether;\n        deal(qToken, address(this), reward);\n        quoteToken.approve(address(d), type(uint256).max);\n        d.addRewards(baseToken, qToken, 0, uint128(reward));\n        assertEq(d.totalPendingRewards(qToken), reward);\n\n        // 3) Trigger unstake to realize pending rewards\n        uint256 beforeLpQuote = quoteToken.balanceOf(lp);\n        uint256 beforeUserQuote = quoteToken.balanceOf(userA);\n\n        vm.prank(userA);\n        LaunchToken(baseToken).transfer(lp, 1); // small decrease in shares\n\n        // 4) Rewards were paid to Launchpad, not user; pending cleared\n        assertEq(d.totalPendingRewards(qToken), 0);\n        assertEq(quoteToken.balanceOf(lp) - beforeLpQuote, reward);\n        assertEq(quoteToken.balanceOf(userA) - beforeUserQuote, 0);\n    }\n\n}\n\n\n```\n</details>",
